WEBVTT

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.510
In the name of Eustiana von Astraea,

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.240
I will protect everyone from you!

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.020
And...

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.950
I will reclaim my kingdom!

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.610
So she's a Princess, is she?

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.250
Eriko!

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.170
It's time.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:24.740
Alrighty then!

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.730
Time to wrap this up with a big bang!

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:34.590
<b><i>Menu 11</i> Those Who Fight Back</b>

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.270
Pecorine...

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:37.260
I'm coming to save you.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:39.810
Karyl!

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.310
Your Majesty?

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.900
Is this what you wanted to do?

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:53.630
No... Not this...

00:00:56.110 --> 00:01:00.130
Ah, my sweet, foolish Karyl...

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:04.650
Perhaps I'll just break you
 right here and now.

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:35.460
I have the perfect opponent
 for you, Princess.

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:38.030
The protector of this kingdom...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:42.410
The captain of Nightmare, the palace knights.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:49.730
Go on, then. Fight each other to the death.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:53.640
Nanaka Infinite Blast!

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:57.180
Yikes, the castle's full of Shadows.

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:59.920
Was this part of the plan, as well?

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:04.950
I'll leave that up to your imagination.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:07.560
I don't care either way...

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:12.790
as long as you give us 
information on the Twilight City.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:15.040
For that, we will...

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:19.240
We just need to set your
 true body free, right?

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:22.280
Yes.

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:30.800
What's this?

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.650
Such a boorish bunch.

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.470
Regina Gaes...

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.960
Metamorregnant, eh?

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.590
Huh? Huh?!

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.310
It can't be... Of the Seven Crowns?

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.500
I see.

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:50.090
In order to get your true body back,

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:53.840
you teamed up with some girls who have faith in their own abilities.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:59.120
If you understand that much, 
could you please move aside?

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.320
I'm afraid not.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.320
Do you...

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:08.710
understand what it would mean
 if that thing awakened?

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.510
Of course I do.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:14.400
And a killing match between
 all these souls and the Kaiser,

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.920
who has gained the powers 
of two of the Seven Crowns,

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.350
should be highly entertaining.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.260
You battle-crazed maniac...

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:25.180
Besides...

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:26.550
Look.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:30.610
Doesn't she look like
 she's just dying to fight?

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.030
This friend of yours, I mean.

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:35.400
Hee hee hee...

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.900
It seems you and I think alike.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.940
Insatiable, aren't you?

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:44.280
You'd better entertain me, then!

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:55.670
Poison Perfume!

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:02.420
It works on the nervous system, eh?

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:06.680
Nanaka Infinite Blast!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:12.380
YOLO!

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.680
Nice teamwork.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:18.990
Very good. Entertain me more.

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:24.800
Hee hee hee...

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.390
Since you want it so badly...

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:30.380
I'll drive this ax deep into your forehead!

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:32.880
Nice! Very nice!

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:37.270
And I'll ram this blade right into your eyes!

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:42.070
I can't!

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:43.660
Don't give up, mister!

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:44.640
There's no end to them?

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:48.660
Are you all right?

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:49.760
Of course!

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:52.710
We gotta hurry to where Peco lady is!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.550
Yes!

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:55.550
Oh, no!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.300
We're sandwiched between them!

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:59.770
This way! Over the bridge!

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.020
Run! Run! Run!

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:15.050
Damn it all!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.200
Li'l Ika!

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:22.330
Bro!

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:27.550
...ro! Kokkoro!

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:28.580
Kokkoro!

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:32.230
Thank goodness! The link worked!

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:38.730
You're not hurt, are you?
 No tummyache or anything?

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:40.980
U-Um...

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.720
Oh, sorry.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:49.820
I've been hearing all about you for so long,

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:53.340
I had the idea in my head
 that we're already friends.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.000
Wait, are you...

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:58.250
Lady Ameth?

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.870
That's my Kokkoro!

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:04.460
I'm not dreaming?

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.580
I'm so glad I didn't give up!

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:09.190
Trying over and over was worth it!

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:10.130
Are you saying...

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:15.140
all those times when I found myself
 lost in darkness recently...

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:19.600
Yes. There's something I just 
had to pass along to you.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:23.240
I can't entrust this to anyone but you,

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:26.830
since I can't interact with the real world.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:32.120
Yuuki's Princess Knight power is unstable.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.500
He could lose control at any time.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:38.620
And if he pushes his body too far, it will...

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:41.080
No...

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:44.950
If it was to save Peco or Karyl,

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:50.220
he wouldn't hesitate to use his power, 
regardless of what it might do to him.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.630
So, Kokkoro...

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:59.040
I want you to keep Yuuki's recklessness, 
his emotions, under control.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.560
Me?

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:06.080
Yes. I can only entrust this key to you

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:08.380
because you've been
 watching him all this time.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:12.730
Please be Yuuki's support.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.000
Of course.

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:25.730
Thank you, Kokkoro.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:32.090
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:35.540
Master!

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:39.600
This is crazy, bud! Just leave me behind!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.310
I'm fine! You're not heavy!

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:44.770
My lord!

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.720
Not heavy... Not heavy...

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:49.370
Not heavy!

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:50.270
Bud...

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:53.690
Keep it up! You're almost there!

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.040
Master!

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.930
Cut it out! My bud here won't
 let you get away with this!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.140
Look up, you two!

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.630
That's it! We can do it!

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:03.860
Yeah!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.590
Please see this!

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.990
We're right here!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:16.930
What in the world...?

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.430
Damn it!

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:22.800
We refuse to go down!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.450
Yay!

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:35.950
Good birdie! Good birdie!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:39.270
Bro! I thought you were a goner!

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:42.210
You doofus! I'm immortal, remember?!

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:45.460
Bro!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:48.320
Thank you for saving my fool son.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:49.590
Mm!

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:01.380
Jun, please let me through!

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:03.830
That won't work.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:07.140
I've made her into a doll who obeys only me.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:10.890
You are absolutely...

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:24.970
No, no, don't take your eyes off the show.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:32.290
You never know when your Knight
 will be impaled on that sword.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:38.600
There, you see?

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:42.150
Enough... That's enough!

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:44.030
Run away, Pecorine!

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:47.060
Forget about me! Just run away!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.340
No! I'm not going anywhere!

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.720
You idiot! If you keep fighting...

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:55.880
Just do what I say for once!

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.020
I'm very selfish, you know.

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:04.790
I swear I'll save you!

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:09.350
Oh, you girls are simply fantastic!

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:12.010
You're making me want 
to torment you even more!

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:16.040
Karyl!

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:40.250
The Sol Tower!

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:41.730
What are those chains?

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:44.090
What the heck is she planning to do?

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:50.550
And now... to bring the end.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:10.260
Let's scatter some crimson flowers 
from the top of your pretty little head!

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:36.930
She's cheating! Isn't that cheating?!

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:49.930
Now, as promised,

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:54.800
I'll ram this sword into your eyes.

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.920
Hee hee hee...

00:11:56.920 --> 00:12:01.450
I promise you, I will drive my ax
 deep into your forehead.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:05.070
You'd better cry out in a nice voice.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:13.570
Behold the gleam of my Evil Eye!

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:18.470
Can you hear the roar of the souls
 who have successfully awakened,

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:20.250
my sworn friend?!

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:23.490
Why don't you leave it at that?

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:26.350
She is our guildmate.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:29.090
It seems you have no concept of manners.

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:32.470
You need to respect the proper 
order of this dance!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:40.740
Oh? I'm impressed you managed
 to block my first strike.

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:45.540
That was way too close.

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:50.370
But thanks to that, I was able 
to work out a counterplan.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:54.410
As the leader of the
 Order of Gehenna Immortals,

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:57.930
I, Hecate of the Gale—

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.080
Hey! You interrupted my signature speech!

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.300
Talk about hot-headed.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:07.130
Anna, we're finishing this!

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.980
Roger that, my sworn friend!

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:13.720
Vortex Thorn, long sealed in purgatory...

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:15.330
Come forth!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.290
Awaken!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:29.300
Behold the splendor of destruction!

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:31.540
Final Catastrophe!

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:42.550
Christina's Seven Crowns power, 
Absolute Defense,

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:45.660
may make her seem invincible at first,

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:49.220
but the power does have a pitfall.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:53.280
If we can create a situation 
that surpasses her computing capability...

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:03.360
Zero Strike: Moon on Water, Flower in Mirror.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:15.290
You did it!

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:21.050
That's our guild master for you!

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:23.180
Not bad.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.650
Numbers Avalon.

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:45.780
But how?! They obviously dodged that!

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.300
How long has it been, I wonder...

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.790
since I took a blow from a sword?

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.550
Absolute Offense...

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:58.340
Too bad for you.

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:03.660
My Numbers Avalon ability gives me
 Absolute Offense and Absolute Defense,

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:07.170
allowing me to land all of my attacks 
and evade all others.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:08.180
Though...

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.740
All things considered, you did well.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:13.310
With that power,

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:18.750
if you teamed up with me,
 we could bend this world to our will.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.530
That doesn't entice me at all.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:25.150
What I desire is stimulation.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:28.370
Stimulation so powerful it burns
 away my life force itself.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:33.650
There's no one but Her Majesty 
who could stand a chance against m—

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:35.560
What?!

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.540
Hee hee hee...

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:41.030
Too bad.

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:42.780
You...

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:49.560
Our goal as Twilight Caravan 
is to set our client free.

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:55.670
It was fun to have the
 opportunity to idly chat again,

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.930
Regina Gaes.

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:00.300
You bloody vixen...

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:05.120
Now, this completes our mission.

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:22.740
For you, that wasn't a bad showing.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.390
You've earned my praise.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:26.670
Oh?

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:29.240
Are you broken already?

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.260
Well, that's no fun.

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.550
I'll force my way through.

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:59.180
Princess...

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.270
Inferno...

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:19.140
...Strike!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:21.660
...Shield!

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:59.480
That was excellent... swordsmanship.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.700
It clearly is the power
 that protects Landosol.

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:07.190
I wanted...

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:13.120
to protect this nation by your side.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.150
I also want

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.460
to protect the smiles of 
this nation's people.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:26.340
This is a farce!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:30.920
Farce! Farce! Farce! Farce!
 Farce! Farce! Farce!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.200
You have to entertain me more!

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:38.930
Show me the light
 that burns life itself!

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:42.850
If you can't do that...

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:46.150
then disappear!

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:59.160
I have caused you so much harm...

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:02.170
You, the master I was meant to protect.

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:10.490
Would you allow me to dedicate my life
 to protect Landosol once more,

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.170
Princess Eustiana?

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:19.670
Of course.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:31.170
You have wronged Landosol!

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:32.890
Prepare yourself!

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:36.480
You're nothing but sacrifices!

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:43.930
Curse you! Curse you! Curse you!

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:54.700
Master!

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:07.780
I'm taking back this kingdom!

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:09.230
And my name!

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:11.740
And Karyl, too!

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:16.190
I won't let you get away with 
hurting all these people.

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.870
Full power, full throttle!

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:25.220
Princess Strike!

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:34.840
Princess Strike!

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:28.980
N-No...

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:33.160
I don't want to disappear...

00:21:34.110 --> 00:21:37.270
I don't want... to die...

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:39.020
A Shadow?!

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:42.380
Death? What is death?

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:45.020
I am a shadow...

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:50.530
I am... I... am...

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.050
Your Majesty!

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:00.900
What's going on?

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:02.480
Another fake?

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:04.870
Didn't they defeat her?

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:09.810
Princess Eustiana, stay back!

00:22:10.500 --> 00:22:13.050
It looks like things got quite busy

00:22:13.420 --> 00:22:15.740
in the short time I was asleep.

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:18.940
Well, no matter.

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:31.100
Jun?!

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:38.930
Your Majesty...

00:22:46.850 --> 00:22:50.130
You two lying there,
 the princess and her little friend...

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:52.990
You will become sacrifices to me.

00:23:11.460 --> 00:23:12.590
This is...

00:23:20.590 --> 00:23:21.860
Yuuki!

00:23:21.860 --> 00:23:22.970
Yuuki!

00:23:23.780 --> 00:23:25.090
Yes...

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:28.980
Of course the one who would
 try to defy me until the very end...

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:31.050
would be you.

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:39.970
Menu 12<b>  Connecting the Pieces with You Once More</b>
